@startuml seq_deploy
' Render to ../images/seq_deploy.pdf
actor User
participant "Angular SPA" as FE
participant "FastAPI Backend" as BE
participant "KServe Operator" as KS
participant "Model Server Pod" as MS
database "Object Store\n(MinIO)" as S3

== Deploy ==
User -> FE : click "Deploy" on a registered model
FE -> BE : POST /api/v1/deployments
BE -> KS : create InferenceService (RawDeployment)
KS -> MS : create Deployment + Service + Ingress
MS -> S3 : load model artifact (storageUri)
MS --> KS : ready
BE --> FE : deployment status + endpoint

== Predict ==
User -> FE : submit sample inputs
FE -> BE : POST /api/v1/deployments/{id}/predict
BE -> MS : forward via cluster API proxy
MS --> BE : predictions
BE --> FE : predictions
FE --> User : show result
@enduml
